            <description><![CDATA[<h2>StudyGuard 1.5.1 — Study Notebook</h2>
<p>Adds Study Notebook to the sidebar: saved sources and notes, cited AI chat with local Ollama, summaries, key points, quizzes, and flashcards. Focus and break timers now survive quitting and reopening the app.</p>
<p>This update is a manual download. Choose <strong>Learn More…</strong>, download the macOS DMG, quit StudyGuard, and replace the app in Applications. Your saved history and settings are retained.</p>
]]></description>
